{"id": "34341", "title": "偷爱花魁", "author": "宝贝", "category": "文学名著", "count": 35, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34341.htm", "intro": "香女阁”的继承人在她满十五岁时，替自己卜上一卦；她要卜算的是自己的爱情，但得到的答案却是－－大凶！当场她就作了决定，她要无爱地过一生。因为她的名字刚好就是－－花无爱！冷酷无情的石翔天为了权势，不惜绑架花无爱，要把她献给皇上！谁知一路上的朝夕相处，竟让他俩情愫暗生……而明知自己到头来只会心碎的花无爱，却执意把她的心、她的灵魂、她的爱都给石翔天！只为了要减轻他的痛苦、要他为自己而活！她的心意，他全然了解。只是他不能让她怀抱着希望；他也不能让她知道，他其实已经爱她爱得再也放不开了！因为他不能让她为了爱他，而以生命作为代价！", "base": "files/article/html/34/34341", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2182226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2182227.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2182228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2182229.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2182230.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2182231.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2182232.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2182233.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2182234.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2182235.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2182236.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2182237.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2182238.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2182239.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2182240.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2182241.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2182242.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2182243.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2182244.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2182245.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2182246.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2182247.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2182248.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2182249.html", "available": false}